OL,4,BKnee surgery rules Sinner out of       
OL,5,BAustralian Open                        
OL,6,GJannik Sinner has been ruled out of    
OL,7,Gthe Australian Open in January         
OL,8,Gfollowing an operation on his knee.    
OL,10,FThe 25-year-old Italian, who won the   
OL,11,F2024 and 2025 titles at Melbourne      
OL,12,FPark, has not played competitively     
OL,13,Fsince winning Wimbledon on 12 July.    
OL,15,FIn a social media post on Tuesday,     
OL,16,Fworld number two Sinner said he had    
OL,17,Fundergone surgery to "improve the      
OL,18,Fcondition of my iliotibial band" - a   
OL,19,Fthick band of tissue that runs along   
OL,20,Fthe outside of the knee.               
